        "id": 8341
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-03-19T14:27:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It wasn\u0027t immediately clear to me what this was referring to the BufferInfo., and we only need it to invoke `returnToPool()` on the DBM, which is also the only place that `fMgr` is used.\n\nCan we consolidate `fInfoIndex` and `fMgr` into just holding a pointer to the `BufferInfo`?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 74,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 74,
        "endChar": 23
      },
      "revId": "966c34243b4eeafcbe8c8d9aed1689fa87c01ec7",
